  "summary": "<p>Under President Donald J. Trump, violent crime is collapsing at a pace unmatched in modern American history. A new mid-year report confirms that homicides are again on track to reach the lowest level in more than a century — building on last year’s extraordinary progress and delivering on one of President Trump’s core promises to [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/07/crime-plummets-another-historic-low-under-president-trump/\">Crime Plummets to Another Historic Low Under President Trump</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
